# Canonical author/committer mapping. GitHub's contributors page
# and `git log --use-mailmap` (default since Git 2.43) honor this
# file. Non-destructive — commit SHAs are unchanged, only the
# displayed author is rewritten.
#
# Format:
#   Canonical Name <canonical@email>                                 <commit@email>
#   Canonical Name <canonical@email>  Commit Name <commit@email>

